  "content": "\n\n<center>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/tDYBzXM0/images/627ffb9b9ee5ab708b70693f0cd030767e990012.png\" alt=\"A cream colored llama with a green bow tie, curly moustache, pipe, monocle and a top hat with a green band\" width=\"965\" height=\"516\" />\n<br/>\n《Better Than Bunnies》的荣耀继任者现已登场！《Dapper Llamas》已就位，<br/>让你的世界更加华丽！\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/tDYBzXM0/images/32271313c58ecdeca7e0ac1741254c34dd78d454.png\" alt=\"A cream colored llama with a green bow tie and top hat. A child llama is following closely behind it with a bow tie, pipe, curly moustache and a fez on the top of its head\" width=\"965\" height=\"516\" />\n<br/>\n费兹帽与卷曲胡须统统包含在内。\n</center>\n<br/>\n模型部分由 <a href=\"https://twitter.com/RazzleberryFox\">RazzleberryFox</a> 制作。\n<br/>\n<br/>可单独禁用服装的各个部件，羊驼的“华丽程度”会经过随机权重计算，从而生成无数种不同的搭配变体！\n<br/>\n<br/>\n本模组仅适用于客户端。\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<a href=\"https://twitter.com/Wyld/status/846489501320982528\">#怪Wyld</a>",
